WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:02.574
Welcome to China Toy Atlas.

00:00:02.524 --> 00:00:10.493
This is your dedicated home for blind boxes, squishies and character toys, with the
original character imagery, collections and sidebar.

00:00:11.017 --> 00:00:14.693
Start by searching a character, brand or series.

00:00:14.643 --> 00:00:18.236
Here, Crybaby brings matching products into view.

00:00:18.236 --> 00:00:23.200
Use the brand, shop, character and product-type filters to narrow the directory.

00:00:23.200 --> 00:00:26.818
Reset all filters brings the full catalog back.

00:00:27.350 --> 00:00:30.906
Choose Select for comparison on the products you want.

00:00:30.856 --> 00:00:35.195
Open Compare in the sidebar, then Open side-by-side comparison.

00:00:35.195 --> 00:00:38.608
You can compare two to six products or shop offers.

00:00:38.608 --> 00:00:42.587
Keep the seller, pack option, market and price date in view.

00:00:43.100 --> 00:00:48.122
The comparison includes photographs, source links and available product details.

00:00:48.072 --> 00:00:52.387
Download comparison CSV saves the evidence and photo links.

00:00:52.387 --> 00:00:55.704
Download photo sheet gives you a visual reference.

00:00:55.704 --> 00:01:00.308
A series image does not guarantee the design inside a random blind box.

00:01:00.850 --> 00:01:04.971
Open Research and news for Stories and news, or Daily updates.

00:01:04.921 --> 00:01:07.805
Each update keeps its sources and dates.

00:01:07.805 --> 00:01:11.964
Catalog additions, announcements and launches are different events.

00:01:11.964 --> 00:01:17.925
Save products to build your own collection, and come back to Explore whenever you want
to discover something new.
